│ how bias arises in randomised trials, and to address user feedback on and limitations of the original                │
│ tool.bmj.com"}, {"study_index": 16, "title": "Techniques, rationale, and outcomes of internal limiting membrane      │
│ peeling", "abstract": "BACKGROUND The internal limiting membrane represents the structural interface between the     │
│ retina and the vitreous and has been postulated to serve several essential functions. Recently, internal limiting    │
│ membrane peeling has been used in the treatment of a variety of retinal disorders. We review the history,            │
