.001). Type 1 closure was observed in 34.04% of patients in group 1 and in 62.79% of patients in group 2 (P = .02). 
mfERG showed improvement in both groups. CONCLUSIONIFT provides superior outcomes compared to SIP and, hence, could be 
considered as the surgical modality of choice in large MH.[Ophthalmic Surg Lasers Imaging Retina. 
2018;49:236–240.]journals.healio.com


