│ lead to increased oxygen stress and thus to lens opacification by oxidation of structural proteins. The key for the  │
│ prevention of cataract formation therefore seems to be avoidance of oxidative stress, factors that might increase    │
│ the protective or repair systems are so far not available. Ventilation with oxygen should be minimised as should be  │
